        "original_id": "44cf0e21-2f83-5b97-8c6e-33e43f0e9165",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Graham, Shane Meadows, Toby Jones, Vicky McClure, Ian Hart\n- Works: Snatch, This Is England, This Is England '86, This Is England '88, This Is England '90, Public Enemies, Pirates of the Caribbean, Boardwalk Empire, The Secret Agent\n- Roles: Tommy, Andrew \"Combo\" Gascoigne, Baby Face Nelson, Scrum, Al Capone\n- Topics: English film and television acting, British drama film, television casting\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Graham was born on 3 August 1973 and is an English film and television actor.\n- Stephen Graham played Tommy in the film Snatch in 2000.\n- This Is England is a 2006 British drama film written and directed by Shane Meadows.\n- Stephen Graham played Andrew \"Combo\" Gascoigne in This Is England in 2006.\n- Stephen Graham played Baby Face Nelson in Public Enemies in 2009.\n- Stephen Graham reprised Andrew \"Combo\" Gascoigne in the television sequels This Is England '86 in 2010, This Is England '88 in 2011, and This Is England '90 in 2015.\n- Stephen Graham played Scrum in the Pirates of the Caribbean films.\n- Stephen Graham played Al Capone in the HBO series Boardwalk Empire.\n- The Secret Agent television series stars Toby Jones, Vicky McClure, Stephen Graham, and Ian Hart.",
